WEBVTT

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.870
Is he reckless?

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.990
Or does he desire death?

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.810
Silver Will

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.050
What shall we do,
Brigadier General?
Silver Will

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:26.960
Recover the commander
unit immediately!
Silver Will

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.210
Recover the commander
unit immediately!

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.350
Samonji...

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.460
Excuse us! Excuse us!

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:34.840
Who are you with?

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.760
Don't leave the Great Wall!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.560
We're Independent Unit 8.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.720
Independent Unit 8?

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.330
We are going to recover our former commander, Captain Ukyou Samonji.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.400
Please let us go.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.960
You can't just...

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.150
Well, isn't that moving?

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.400
Not really.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.060
Is it okay to say something like that?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.950
In situations like this, what's important is momentum.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.570
Come in, 8th Unit.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:01.360
Stop Ukyou Samonji.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.150
That is an order!

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.410
Understood.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.710
The bastard went crazy...

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.550
Take it back if you have to kill him!

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:11.300
Yes, sir.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.140
Follow Independent Unit 8.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.310
Don't let the hero of the battle of the Great Wall die in vain.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.220
Save Samonji!

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.000
Lies...

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.430
Yeah.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.230
But we'll take advantage of this situation.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:32.860
An attack?

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:35.070
Didn't the enemy withdraw?

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.490
Our allies have started attacking, too?

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:37.700
They're here?

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.210
Not you.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.500
Argevollen, where are you?

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.680
Everyone but you and I are enemies.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.420
Fight according to your own discretion.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:11.840
There it is! Arge!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:17.860
Stay focused, Tokimune!

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.870
Thank you, Silfy-san!

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:20.990
I'm here, too!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.490
You'll fight me!

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.710
Arge has noticed me.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:28.120
Okay.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.920
Akane-chan,

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.640
sorry if we don't get to have dinner.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:36.420
No! You're not allowed to say that!

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:38.880
I demand pasta!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:39.550
Over.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.000
A mother is strong.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:41.930
She's a mother already?

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.680
Normally Tokimune would get into a close combat fight by now.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.470
Right, right.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:48.810
There's the knife!

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.070
Believe in his simplicity!

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.520
I'm counting on you, playboy.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:53.690
Pasta, pasta.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.610
Tokimune-kun always aims for the head first.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.820
Go!

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.000
Now, Lorenz!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.530
Lorenz!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.760
I'm okay.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:22.870
Hurry, Tokimune!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:24.800
Let's go!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:25.510
Right!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.690
Senpai, leave this to me!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.100
Namie!

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.440
Just a little more!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.330
Lorenz!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.150
I know!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:45.990
Hurry!

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.660
We can't do this forever!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.330
Listen to me!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.890
Not yet! Hang in there, Lorenz!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.890
Pasta!

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:13.900
Jamie Hazaford.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.680
ID Number 06120530.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:19.150
Activation authorization confirmed!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:19.810
All right!

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:21.890
Transcription: Jamie Hazaford.

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:22.610
Dive!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.240
This isn't what I saw last time...

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.650
No!

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.460
Look at me! Me!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.460
Look at me, Argevollen!

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.370
Senpai!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.900
Okay, Tokimune!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.210
Get going!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:12.910
Jamie-san!

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:16.170
Jamie-chan! Namie-chan!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:16.870
Hurry!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.380
Sergeant!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:46.240
Where are you, Argevollen?!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:48.870
There?

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.410
You're not Argevollen!

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:01.210
Was this the only reason you called Richthofen from the start?

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.160
No.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.430
No matter how the battle ended up,

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:09.050
I wanted him to live out his dream, perhaps.

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:13.500
I'll see your ending through.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:18.040
We will lure in the enemy and attempt to surround them further.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:37.040
Damn it! Not you!

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.380
Where are you, Samonji-san?

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.750
Message from the special combat engineers.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.020
They will make contact with the commander unit shortly.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.050
It's ironic.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:55.400
The larger the force you command,

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.430
the more defenseless your own mech becomes.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.400
There he is.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.150
Samonji-san!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:06.820
Where are you?

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.040
Where are you, Argevollen?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.780
I've found you.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.780
Samonji-san!

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.660
Activate Fascinator.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.170
That bastard.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:34.900
I see... So you're planning to die out there.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.230
Brigadier General! Trouble!

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:36.970
What is it?

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:38.980
A massive army is approaching from the rear.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.040
They're here to end the fight.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.100
Colonel Izumi, isn't it?

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.080
Again.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.000
I'm being pulled away again.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.930
I won't give it to anyone.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.540
The U-Link System, Silver Will,

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.020
is what Reika wanted.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.070
It was her dream.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.590
And to use it like this...

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.520
Look at this battlefield...

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:37.950
Just before the last experiment, Reika told me

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.220
to watch her.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:45.210
But she died before I could face her.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.030
So I will see the Silver Will to the end...

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:52.280
To the very end.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.640
Get out of Argevollen.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.750
I can't see...

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:28.290
Tokimune!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.050
Why are you just sitting there?

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:33.840
She belongs to you and me!

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.150
Believe in that and fight!

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.720
You're right.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.320
I can't just watch.

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:46.350
I need to catch her.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.560
Argevollen.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.430
You belong to us.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.500
Why can you move?

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:22.700
You're such a dumb-ass.

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:27.000
Thanks to you, we're still alive.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:30.860
The battlefield may be ugly,

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:34.940
but thanks to you, I was able to be a part of the unit.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.860
I felt like I had a place to belong.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:41.350
And now you're doing this?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:43.730
For who?

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.650
For my sister?

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:46.870
No!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.720
What you're doing is pure selfishness!

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:54.630
Don't use my sister's name for something like that!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.630
Don't you dare!

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.530
Captain Samonji.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:04.530
Let's end this.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.510
You're right.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.880
Let's end it.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:22.800
What?

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.180
What is this?

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:34.060
Silver Will... All the U-Link systems will die here.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.550
As will we.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.560
What is this?

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:55.540
No!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.460
Everything's going away!

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.350
No! Stop it!

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.330
I found you.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.180
I kept my promise.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.530
I'll be with you soon.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:35.060
Did you watch me?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.480
He chose his own death?

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:47.910
Central Command has issued an order for a truce.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.100
They're well-prepared.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.370
Send out a retreat order.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.220
Yes, sir.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.650
But once the fire's been lit

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.670
on my ambitions, it won't be easy to put out.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.300
I'll follow you.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.050
Foolish man.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:40.600
Well done.

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:42.460
Yeah.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.550
I had to die...

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.820
For some reason, that's how I felt.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.480
It was so painful and lonely.

00:13:55.570 --> 00:13:56.980
I was about to disappear.

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:00.230
But you didn't.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.060
I was inside it.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.110
And...

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.120
So were you.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.410
Yeah.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.480
Why...

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.420
Hey, it's me.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.890
My army got wiped out by Izumi's.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:10.070
Ingelmia retreated, too.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:13.470
Your and Izumi's plan worked.

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:19.060
Though it looks like your real goal was something different.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:27.070
In the end, we were forced to play along with a dual suicide between you and Reika Nanjou.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.630
How stupid.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.930
If you want to die,

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:34.730
this may be mercy to you.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.100
But when I think that, it makes me not want to shoot you.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.080
I also need to settle things.

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:42.270
Yes, come in.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.520
You all packed?

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.660
Yup.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:52.780
When I rebooted Argevollen, I felt a lot of different things.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:56.210
I was able to receive your feelings.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.270
I was happy.

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.540
I guess that's what it means to face someone.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.100
Koshi-san says he's bringing the trailer around.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:13.380
Is that okay?

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.260
I'm not with the military anymore.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.030
More importantly, what are you doing after this?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.640
Kybernes went bankrupt, right?

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:20.850
Yeah.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.750
It was all really sudden.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:26.780
Well, if Argevollen's gone, there's nothing for me to do.

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:29.330
Who's that?

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:31.560
Who is it?

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.510
Suguro-san.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.300
Speak of the devil...

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.650
Yes, this is Hazaford.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.670
Sorry.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.210
I've been busy cleaning things up.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:42.890
It wasn't for a long time, but good work.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:47.050
I put your severance package into your account. Check it.

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:47.670
Bye.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:49.930
What'd he say?

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.830
He said I got a severance package...

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:54.060
How much is it?

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:00.930
I got the amount wrong by three digits,

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.700
but oh well.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.200
My, my...

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:08.020
We got a lot of secondary benefits out of it, so it's all right.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.460
I need to think of the name of the next company.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.630
I've done my duty.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:21.260
I'll continue to keep an eye on Viltriveld.

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:22.280
I see.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.590
Silver Will is gone,

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:28.290
but the idea for the system itself remains.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.550
Samonji says he saw Reika inside the system.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:36.300
Is that possible?

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.750
I don't know.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:40.870
If he says he saw it, that's good enough for me.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.630
To him, that's what Silver Will was.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.310
What punishment was the field marshal given?

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.510
Punishment?

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:52.310
Samonji is the hero who took back the Great Wall.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:56.260
People are starting to treat the late Brigadier General Cayenne as a hero.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.280
No rewards, but no punishment either.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:03.080
I quit the military because I hated that stuff.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:07.080
So the field marshal's war is going to continue, then?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.570
Yeah.

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:12.770
We're going to have Samonji follow an even crueler path.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.510
That's his wish, too.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.100
Maybe...

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.730
It'll be you who becomes a real field marshal.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:28.100
Thanks for the lift.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.840
Why say that, after all we've been through?

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:31.760
That's right.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:33.110
We'll go to the capital together.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.610
I told you you were worrying too much.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.010
But still...

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.620
So where did you decide to work next?

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:48.190
I'm going to start by hitting
up Kybernes's rivals.

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:49.080
Like that setting sun,
ano yuuhi mitai ni

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.620
I can claim I've had
all kinds of experience.
ano yuuhi mitai ni
